<title>USA: Guidant says first European implants done.</title>
<headline>Guidant says first European implants done.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guidant Corp said the first seven implants of its Ventak AV automatic implantable cardioverter defibrillator were accomplished in Europe.</p>
<p>The new implantable defibrillator is the first system to incorporate Atrial View, or AV, a rhythm discrimination capability, along with other features, said the medical device maker.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
